## ABOUT THIS PROJECT
VLSI Circuit Simulator

This project is a Python-based VLSI Circuit Simulator that enables users to create, simulate, and analyze digital circuits at the gate level. The simulator supports basic logic gates such as AND, OR, NOT, NAND, NOR, XOR, and XNOR, allowing users to visualize circuit behavior and verify outputs for different input combinations.

Features
Logic gate simulation
Digital circuit design and testing
Truth table generation
Gate-level circuit analysis
User-friendly graphical interface (Tkinter)
Real-time output visualization
Extensible architecture for adding new components
